(text "Alarmes, painel, RTC e ventoinha" (at 20 10 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 5771966e-7c6b-5c3a-914c-a525832f6c42))
(text "4 entradas optoacopladas com comum (12-24 V, ou contato seco usando o +12 V auxiliar), 4 relés SPDT para a remota do abrigo, LEDs do painel, relógio de tempo real com bateria, controle da ventoinha e console serial." (at 20 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid d4fe568f-bfa2-5c22-837f-0fc3f5df94e0))
(text "- Entrada ativa = GPIO em 0. Relé ligado = GPIO em 1 (ULN2003A)." (at 20 22.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 594e35cc-c033-5953-b261-4b8f171110a6))
(text "- Borne J8: IN1 IN2 IN3 IN4 COM +12V(aux, 100 mA). Contato seco: ligar entre +12V(aux) e INx, com COM no GND; sinal externo de 12-24 V: INx positivo e COM negativo." (at 20 25.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 73eef1e3-06e7-5b98-9577-9840571f6229))
(text "- Borne J9: C/NA/NF dos relés 1 a 4, nessa ordem." (at 20 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid dc891e74-8fb1-573e-9c08-84f32cadb845))
(text "Marcos Silva dos Santos (MarcosObel) - github.com/aragonxpd154/LiveSafe-Placa - CERN-OHL-S-2.0" (at 20 408 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 84a5c6bf-ba5c-560d-98eb-abcce7768654))
